@startuml
actor App
participant Storage
participant RecoveryModel
database Files

App -> Storage : load contacts
activate Storage
Storage -> RecoveryModel : recover(source)
activate RecoveryModel

RecoveryModel -> Files : read original file
Files --> RecoveryModel : original bytes

loop Each record in stored order
    RecoveryModel -> RecoveryModel : validate and check conflicts
    alt Valid and non-conflicting
        RecoveryModel -> RecoveryModel : retain contact
    else Invalid or conflicting
        RecoveryModel -> RecoveryModel : record skipped position and reason
    end
end

RecoveryModel -> Files : archive unchanged original\nand recovery report
note right of RecoveryModel
    Archiving applies to extensions 2b and 2c.
    It is skipped in the MSS.
end note

alt Contacts recovered
    RecoveryModel -> Files : write and verify recovered file
    RecoveryModel -> Files : replace active file\nif original is unchanged
    RecoveryModel --> Storage : recovered result
    Storage --> App : startup result
    App -> App : display recovered/skipped counts\nand backup/report locations
else No contacts recovered
    note right of RecoveryModel
        Active file remains unchanged.
        Backup and report are preserved.
    end note
    RecoveryModel --> Storage : throws IOException
    Storage --> App : propagates IOException
    ref over App, Files
        Extension 2c: safe fresh-start choice
    end ref
end

deactivate RecoveryModel
deactivate Storage

note over RecoveryModel, Files
    Archive or replacement failure also routes to extension 2c.
end note
@enduml
